              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imibundu, ubude bayo bungangesandla, yayifakiwe ngaphakathi inxa zonke. Ematafuleni kwakuzabekwa inyama yomnikelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
