              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waselinganisa iguma, ubude balo baba yizingalo ezilikhulu, lobubanzi balo buzingalo ezilikhulu, inxa zonke. Ialtare laliphambi kwethempeli.",
          "type": "text",
