              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubude bendlu esekungeneni babuzingalo ezingamatshumi amabili, lobubanzi bayo buzingalo ezilitshumi lambili; kwakukhona izinyathelo ezilitshumi eziya kilo; kwakukhona insika ekungeneni kwesango inxa zombili.",
